Description: settings manager for the MangoWM Wayland compositor
 Mango Settings is a GTK 3 configuration tool for the MangoWM Wayland
 compositor. It edits MangoWM's configuration files in place while
 preserving comments, ordering, symlinks and file permissions, and
 writes changes atomically after creating timestamped backups.
 .
 It provides pages for appearance, animations, layouts, keybindings,
 workspaces, window rules, monitors, input devices, startup apps,
 theming and wallpapers, plus a keybinding editor with conflict
 detection and headless configuration validation with --check.

